<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-legacy-observations> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Keep the names-only reviewed V2 denominator in one tracked closed file with exact permissible source content digests and explicit nonclaims. The secret-bearing untracked V2 environment source is never copied or digested; bind only the canonical names-and-reviewed-alias projection and state that disposition explicitly. The file contains the three host transports; Codex gpt-5.6-sol and gpt-5.5 observations; OpenRouter anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6; MiniMax OAuth MiniMax-M3; the direct OpenAI gpt-5.5 unavailability; the unresolved Nous openai/gpt-5.6-sol route; and the antigravity claude-opus-4.6 configured default. Every row is historical-only, excluded and UNQUALIFIED until independently configured and requalified in V3; the file contains no secret values, session identifiers, host paths or live admission authority." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
