<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-credential-containment> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Read only one explicitly selected owner-only untracked environment file; report presence only for the exact configured and reviewed mapped candidate credential-name set, retain every other public catalogue label in named denominators and aliases, and never copy, print, digest, persist or forward a credential value or reveal the selected path." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
