<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-runtime-credential-source> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Treat a legacy V1/V2 environment file only as a names-only import source. Normal V3 live operations select an owner-only untracked repository-local .env or .usf/home projection containing only the exact allowlisted variables for the selected route; never copy, graph, digest or persist secret values." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-identity> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-identity> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Keep requested route, provider, route model, underlying family and model, adapter, credential name and host transport identity distinct; preserve unknown rather than guessing aliases." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
