<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-account-tier> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Before provider inference, use one separately authorized provider-owned non-inference account source to admit a trusted current exact-account tier receipt proving zero paid cost, paid usage disabled, automatic overage disabled, bounded quota applicability and source authenticity; self-authored assertions, promotional credit and model prose are insufficient." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
