<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-adapter-preflight> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Content-verify the exact installed adapter artifact and launch it in a scrubbed child that receives only the selected credential variable, fixed origin, zero-paid ceiling, bounded tokens, timeout and no fallback before provider contact." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
