<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-authenticated-answer> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Acquire provider-produced answers only after current receipt and adapter gates, recording requested and actual identity, sanitized usage, quota, latency, service tier and zero-paid evidence without persisting secrets or full private transcripts." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
