<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-hidden-holdout> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Evaluate genuine hidden holdout cases unavailable to the answer-producing route and bind the exact provider, model, adapter, auth mode, prompt, tool, context, output, suite, corpus and policy versions; default every unmatched or missing answer to UNQUALIFIED." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-routing> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-routing> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "For every qualified work composition, make the complete current set of semantically qualified provider-model routes available for consideration; route purely from exact current census, economics, probe, authorization and task-profile facts; explain every selection, exclusion or deferral; enforce finite host and provider concurrency; and prohibit preference-based concealment plus paid or unknown fallback." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
