<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-no-contact-boundary> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Inventory disabled, excluded and missing-credential routes, but enforce exclusion before credential lookup, adapter construction or provider-engine construction; census and other declared no-contact operations cannot acquire run authority or contact a provider." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
