<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-policy-authorization> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Derive one immutable effective policy as the narrowest intersection of graph, operator, task and route bounds; explicit empty allowlists deny all, unknown cost never becomes free, subscription CLI and API billing identities remain distinct, provider-owned non-inference account-source contact requires its own exact nonreplaceable authorization, and provider inference rechecks a distinct exact nonreplaceable run authorization immediately before invocation." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
