<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-lazy-fair-qualification> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Qualify only current uncovered task roles through deterministic bounded cheapest-first cohorts, count each exact model identity at most once per authorization, reconcile uncertain reservations before retry, fairly drain eligible provider queues across repeated bounded runs, and retain an explicit terminal disposition for every configured identity." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
